# lab.surface: the merge game (iron + gears) again, in the sensing worker's lab region (x 300..420,
# y 400..560 of the lab surface), to test the live look, notify and the alert push. A copy of
# games/lab-merge with its plots moved. The lab rules: free materials, direct building.
# The lab surface is 2048x2048 (x and y from -1024 to 1023): every plot stays inside it.
surface  lab
mode     lab
terrain  none
catalog  base

place iron  = iron  plot 310,420 20x24
place gears = gears plot 332,420 16x16

robots works: cover iron, gears

watch plots:      keep
watch sanctioned: mark 2h
notify            all                   # the lab default, written out
remind            20s                   # a short alert reminder cadence, for the test
